---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, PHONE_DISPLAY } from '../data/site';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Refund & Replacement Policy | LeadVault"
  description="LeadVault's replacement guarantee for invalid records, and how refunds and deposits are handled for custom projects and subscriptions."
  path="/refund-replacement-policy"
  heading="Refund & Replacement Policy"
  lastUpdated="August 15, 2026"
>
  <p>
    LeadVault stands behind every delivery with a replacement guarantee. This page explains how it
    works, and how refunds are handled where a replacement isn't the right fix.
  </p>

  <h2>Our Replacement Guarantee</h2>
  <p>
    If more than <strong>5%</strong> of records in any delivery prove invalid within 14 days of
    delivery, we replace them free of charge. "Invalid" means a record that was inaccurate or
    undeliverable at the time we verified it — not a contact who has since changed roles, updated
    their details, or otherwise become outdated after delivery.
  </p>
  <p>To request a replacement:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Contact us within 14 days of delivery.</li>
    <li>Tell us which records you believe are invalid and why (e.g. hard bounce, wrong number).</li>
    <li>We review and, where the 5% threshold is met, replace the affected records at no charge.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Refunds</h2>
  <p>
    We prioritize replacement over refunds — it gets you the working data you actually ordered.
    Where a delivery genuinely can't be corrected to your specification, we'll work with you to make
    it right, which may include a partial or full refund depending on the circumstances. Refunds, if
    issued, are returned via your original payment method.
  </p>

  <h2>Custom Project Deposits</h2>
  <p>
    Custom data projects require a 50% deposit to begin work, with the balance due on delivery. The
    deposit secures your project slot and covers initial sourcing work; once work has begun,
    deposits are generally non-refundable, though we'll always work with you in good faith if a
    project needs to change scope or be cancelled early.
  </p>

  <h2>Monthly Subscriptions</h2>
  <p>
    Subscription plans can be cancelled at any time, effective at the end of the current billing
    cycle. We don't provide partial refunds for the remainder of a cycle already paid for, and the
    replacement guarantee above still applies to any lead batch already delivered within that cycle.
  </p>

  <h2>How to Request a Replacement or Refund</h2>
  <p>
    Email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> or message us on WhatsApp at{' '}
    {PHONE_DISPLAY} with your order details and the issue you've run into. We aim to respond and
    resolve requests promptly.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this policy from time to time. The "Last updated" date above reflects the most
    recent revision.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
